course: dictionary
lesson: 3669
title: Fit, fitter, fittest
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Fitter is the comparing form of fit. When you compare two things, you add -er: fit becomes fitter, and people who train become fitter. «Exercise makes you fitter.» This means you become healthier and stronger than before.
explain: Look at the words around fitter to find its meaning. If the sentence is about sport or PE, fitter is about your body. «Our PE teacher said we would get fitter by running every week.» The clues are PE and running, so fitter means healthier and stronger.
explain: Fitter can also be a noun, the name of a job. «A kitchen fitter came to put in our new cupboards.» The clues are kitchen and cupboards: a fitter is a worker who puts things in place. Ask yourself: is the word describing someone, or naming someone? That tells you which meaning to use.
fact: Fitter is the comparing form of fit: fit, fitter, fittest.
fact: «Fitter» can mean more fit, which means healthier and stronger, especially from exercise.
fact: A fitter is a worker who puts parts of machines, kitchens, gas pipes or carpets in place.
fact: A fitter can also be a person who fits clothes or shoes on people.
fact: Phrases like «a gas fitter» and «a kitchen fitter» show the job meaning, while «get fitter» shows the fitness meaning.
exercise: «Exercise makes you fitter.» What does fitter mean here? | Dirtier from the mud | *Healthier and stronger | Taller than before | Slower and sleepier
exercise: «A gas fitter came to put in our new boiler.» What is a gas fitter? | A person who sells gas in bottles | *A worker who puts gas pipes and machines in place | A teacher of science | A doctor who checks your heart
exercise: Which word is the comparing form of fit? | fitness | fitting | fitted | *fitter
test: Which phrase shows the job meaning of fitter? | fitter today | fitter and stronger | get fitter | *a kitchen fitter
test: «After six weeks of training, Sam felt fitter and stronger.» What does fitter mean? | Tired and sleepy | Smaller and lighter | *Healthier and more fit | Wetter from the rain
exam: «The carpet fitter laid the new carpet in one morning.» What is a carpet fitter? | A person who cleans carpets in a shop | *A worker who puts carpets in place | A dog that sleeps on carpets | A shop assistant who sells rugs
